From 2ff0f511032197cd16b632e8dd6ad4fbeab91126 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alec Gordon <alecg95@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 21:02:40 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] provision: bring the manuscript in with the Authoring
 Assistant's own converter and front-page line; app-centred welcome email

Chapters keep the Word file's name, as the app names them, so bringing the same
chapter in again from the app replaces it. No front matter on chapters (the app
adds none). pandoc from jgm/pandoc releases, pinned with PANDOC_VERSION.
APP_DOWNLOAD_URL puts the app's download in the welcome email.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018UfPMbuFVLu4XgLaag8qvX
